message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Touch To Talk: Communication for Individuals with Numbness and Immobility"
type: software
abstract: "A combined hardware and software (embedded systems) project: an Arduino Nano-based assistive communication and heart-rate monitoring system for paralyzed patients. Touch sensors trigger messages shown on an LCD and spoken by a voice module; a pulse sensor raises a buzzer alert on abnormal heart rate. Firmware developed in the Arduino IDE."
